            <div xml:id="d288-a1">

                <pb facs="0583" n="545" sameAs="frus:frus1951v03p1/pg545"/>

                <p>There followed a discussion as to the nature of the defense board and it seemed
                    to be generally agreed that this board would be advisory in nature, would
                    include such representatives of the local countries as cared to join it and
                    would deal with political and economic as well as military matters.</p>
            </div>
